==Battleground==
*6 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
*3 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Kaijin Doge]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Gory]] spawns as the boss.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

